<title>USA: Austin Texas, won by First Southwest.</title>
<headline>Austin Texas, won by First Southwest.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Southwest said it won $18.400 million of Austin, Texas, limited tax, tax notes taxable Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 6.9884 percent.</p>
</text>
